                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJMWntDkKvQjQRsx5Fq4wUzCU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsd1prNDFiMmxGZURkU1Myd3daSGhrU2pNNVUwRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Breakfast on New Year\u0027s Eve!\nThe business was booming, and the digital payment option was very convenient!\n\n🌟Braised Pork Platter\nThe braised pork sauce was incredibly fragrant and delicious! The scrambled eggs in the platter were so smooth and creamy, with a wonderful aroma. The freshly fried fries were super crispy. The toast was perfectly toasted. A truly impeccable platter, highly recommended!\n\n🌟Scallion Pancake with Egg\nEven just one bite was amazing! Very crispy and not greasy at all. One bite after another with the chili sauce, finished in a minute!\n\n🌟Hot Coffee\nEven the coffee was excellent, fragrant and delicious!\n\n🌟Slightly Sweet Iced Black Tea\nFor someone like me who doesn\u0027t like things too sweet, the black tea was just the right amount of sweet, not cloying, and very fragrant. Plus, the lack of ice was fantastic!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "除夕早餐上來吃\n生意非常好，可以數位支付非常方便！\n\n🌟醬燒豬拼盤\n醬燒豬肉醬汁超香濃好吃好驚艷\n拼盤內的炒蛋好滑嫩奶油香氣重好棒\n現炸薯條超酥脆\n吐司烤的江江好程度\n真是無可挑剔非常推薦的拼盤組合\n\n🌟蔥抓餅加蛋\n只一口也是好驚艷 非常酥脆沒有油膩味\n一口接一口搭配辣醬一分鐘完食\n\n🌟熱咖啡\n連咖啡也不馬乎，香濃好喝！\n\n🌟微糖冰紅茶\n對於怕甜的我來說，紅茶真的是微甜不膩還有香氣，而且沒有冰塊太棒了！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
