                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This brunch spot near Shin Kong Hospital has a clean and bright dining area. It\u0027s not crowded on weekdays. Please help with waste disposal after you finish eating. The Japanese radish cake is quite unique. I\u0027d definitely go back for it if I\u0027m ever in that area again!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "位於新光醫院附近的早午餐店，用餐區乾淨明亮，平日人不多，用餐完畢後需幫忙回收，日式蘿蔔糕蠻特別的，如果有過去那附近會再去吃～",
